    <node id="Sofa">
      <data key="d0">Sofa</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The sofa is a comfortable seating furniture piece designed for multiple people, typically found in a living room. It is often upholstered and composed of cushions and a frame, which enhances its comfort and appeal. One particular model described is a light gray sofa characterized by a clean design. Generally, sofas feature three cushions, contributing to their functionality as a cozy seating option for various social settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be sat on;"provide seating";"provide_seating;"provides seating;"sit;lay against;offers comfort";place items";relax";support_relaxation";used for lounging."</data>
      <data key="d4">"Limited to indoor use;"N/A";may not withstand outdoor weather."</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"Positioned in the background of the room near the potted plant."&lt;SEP&gt;"background, toward the right side; partially obstructed behind the robotic arm"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Sofa is an essential piece of seating furniture that offers both comfort and style in a living space. Specifically, it is described as a gray couch featuring soft cushions, ideal for relaxation. This central piece of furniture is prominently positioned at the heart of the indoor setting, facilitating a comfortable seating area. A notable detail of the arrangement is a yellow cup placed slightly to the left of center on the sofa's seating area, which adds a touch of charm to its surroundings. The design of the sofa accommodates multiple people, enhancing both the comfort and aesthetic appeal of the relaxation space within the living environment. Additionally, it is observed in the background, partially obscured by a robotic arm, indicating its integration into a contemporary setting. Overall, the sofa serves as a key element in creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere in the home.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ed092f1865d58b7fa4dcdda8b5d017b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3766328c3cde2e0365b9ffc47d9f6bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d95292d79ecefc8be8a2545b74f251&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8dfff6f8b76245965ff5da952e9b121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9ad9f9d9ea63530e30288fe9253a7c</data>
