    <node id="Exercise Ball">
      <data key="d0">Exercise Ball</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A large, gray, inflatable ball; used in exercise routines for stability and balance."&lt;SEP&gt;The Exercise Ball is a large, inflatable orb utilized for physical exercise, specifically designed for balance and stability training. It is a spherical object that serves purposes in both balance and strength training activities. Typically, the exercise ball is round and firm when properly inflated, providing a reliable surface for various exercises. An example of this type is a medium-to-large gray exercise ball, which features a smooth surface, enhancing its usability in workout routines.&lt;SEP&gt;"A round, inflatable ball typically made of PVC, used for improving stability and core strength in various exercises."</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be rolled;"Can be used for fitness workouts, sitting, and balance training.";"balance;"can be used for sitting;"sit;"support_balanace;balance exercises;balance training";enhance_workout";exercise;sat on;strengthen";stretching";used for balance exercises."</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"Not suitable for high-impact usage;should be kept away from sharp objects."</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The Exercise Ball is situated centrally within the room, specifically positioned towards the center-left area. It rests on a light gray rug, with its location described as being in the midsection of the space. The Exercise Ball is also noted to be closer to a small table and near a bicycle, further defining its placement within the room's layout.</data>
      <data key="d7">An exercise ball is a large, inflated ball used for physical exercise, balance training, and rehabilitation.&lt;SEP&gt;An exercise ball is a large, round object made of durable material, used for fitness exercises and stability. It is generally inflatable and serves multiple purposes for physical training.&lt;SEP&gt;The Exercise Ball is a large, gray sphere designed for fitness and exercise activities, characterized by its smooth surface. It plays a crucial role in enhancing physical fitness through various exercises and balance training. Situated on a light gray rug in the center of an indoor exercise area, the Exercise Ball is utilized to assist individuals with their fitness routines, aiding in balance and strength training.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-b3766328c3cde2e0365b9ffc47d9f6bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d95292d79ecefc8be8a2545b74f251&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8dfff6f8b76245965ff5da952e9b121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169309fedde4a9cb38576d40b2edaa65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a40a7080f080163a5b021c623248055</data>
