    <node id="Blue Robotic Arm">
      <data key="d0">Blue Robotic Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"Mechanical arm characterized by its blue color with white accents and gray gripping mechanism."&lt;SEP&gt;The Blue Robotic Arm is a large and sophisticated robotic arm designed primarily for automation in various industrial settings and robotic tasks. It stands out with its distinct blue color, complemented by white accents, and is equipped with a gray gripping mechanism that facilitates object handling. This mechanical arm serves as an automated device specifically engineered for performing tasks within a workspace, showcasing its utility in efficiently interacting with and managing a wide range of objects. Additionally, it features a metallic or beige gripper, further enhancing its capability to operate effectively in diverse environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can interact with objects on surfaces;"grasp;"interact with objects;"manipulate items;gripping;manipulate";manipulating";move;perform tasks";potentially used for gripping or manipulating items."</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">The Blue Robotic Arm is currently idle, hovering above or near the countertop. This status has been consistently reported, indicating that the arm is not in operation at this time. There are also entries labeled as "N/A," suggesting there may be no additional pertinent information or activities associated with the arm at this moment.</data>
      <data key="d6">The Blue Robotic Arm is depicted in the upper right corner of the image, where it is hovering above a countertop. This positioning is consistently described across multiple descriptions, indicating that the robotic arm is located on the counter in the same upper right portion of the image.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Blue Robotic Arm is a mechanical device designed for various tasks in a workspace, featuring visible joints for movement and a gripping mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blue Robotic Arm is a mechanical device identifiable by its distinctive blue color and equipped with a gripping mechanism, which signifies its capability for manipulation. It is situated in the upper right portion of a kitchen-like environment, positioned above a black object on the countertop, indicating its active role in assisting with various tasks. The arm is designed for automation, highlighting its efficiency in grasping and moving objects, thereby enhancing functionality in the kitchen setting.</data>
