    <node id="Red Apple">
      <data key="d0">Red Apple</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">Red Apple is a small to medium-sized round fruit that is typically red in color. It is commonly consumed fresh, but can also be used in cooking.</data>
