    <node id="Kitchen Utensil">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Utensil</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "Kitchen Utensil" refers to a general category of tools utilized for food preparation and cooking. These utensils are essential items found in kitchens, aiding in the process of preparing meals and various food items.</data>
