      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">A kitchen utensil encompasses a wide range of tools essential for culinary tasks. This broader category includes items such as spatulas, knives, measuring cups, and spoons, which are used for preparing and serving food. Kitchen utensils play a crucial role in various cooking processes, facilitating the efficient and effective handling of ingredients.</data>
