    <node id="Black Spatula">
      <data key="d0">Black Spatula</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Black Spatula is a kitchen utensil specifically designed for flipping or serving food. It is typically made from heat-resistant materials, making it suitable for use in various cooking applications. The spatula's primary function is to aid in the flipping or serving of food, ensuring that meals can be prepared and enjoyed with ease.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used to flip;"flip;serve;serve";serve_food";stir;transfer food items";transfer"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"not_suitable_for_high-temperature_use_if_made_of_plastic;"not_suitable_for_high-temperature_use_if_plastic;requires_cleaning"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The Black Spatula is described as being situated in different locations on a countertop or table within the provided descriptions. In one instance, it is depicted in the "lower-center area of the countertop," and another description also places it in the "lower-center area of the countertop" with the handle pointing towards the bottom-right corner. Additionally, the spatula is mentioned as being "near the center-left of the image," where it is positioned diagonally on the table with its handle pointing lower-left. Overall, the Black Spatula can be visualized as occupying a prominent position in the lower-center region while also being noted for its diagonal placement in the center-left area, reflecting its versatility in arrangement.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Black Spatula is a versatile kitchen utensil designed primarily for cooking tasks such as flipping, turning, and serving food. It boasts a flat and wide shape, allowing for efficient food preparation. This spatula is typically oriented at an angle on the countertop, making it readily accessible during cooking. Constructed from heat-resistant materials, it can withstand high temperatures, although care is required in its use and cleaning to maintain its functionality and longevity. Overall, the Black Spatula is an essential tool for anyone engaged in culinary activities, offering both practicality and durability in the kitchen.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-1acaff11bbff5a86e31bcdd5bfb75840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdc906fd17b2cd2dc03c0315b87b8508</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
