    <node id="Cabinetry">
      <data key="d0">Cabinetry</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">Cabinetry refers to storage furniture commonly utilized in kitchens for organization and display purposes. It typically consists of storage units made from wood, which are often situated next to appliances such as refrigerators. One distinctive feature of this cabinetry can include wooden surfaces that incorporate brown vertical stripes, enhancing the aesthetic appeal in both kitchen and living room settings. Overall, cabinetry serves as a functional and decorative element in home interiors.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"Provides storage (open and close).";"open;close"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Center of the image frame"&lt;SEP&gt;"Next to the refrigerator, indicating proximity in a kitchen setting."&lt;SEP&gt;"next to the refrigerator"</data>
      <data key="d7">Cabinetry refers to furniture or built-in fixtures designed to provide storage space, commonly found in kitchens or living areas. In the context of the described image, it is positioned at the center of the frame, highlighting its role in domestic settings. The cabinetry is characterized by a textured vertical wood grain pattern, which not only enhances the aesthetic appeal of the kitchen but also suggests a harmonious integration with other elements, such as the nearby refrigerator.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-73995cd074f2d02e31397068516bddbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3699944aea7cf0fb421f72ed8a80c364</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d10">1772710123</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Kitchen">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"A space within a home designed for cooking and food preparation"&lt;SEP&gt;"A space within a home designed for cooking and food preparation."&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen is a designated space or room specifically designed for cooking and food preparation. It is essential in both home and commercial establishments, as it is equipped with various appliances and surfaces that facilitate culinary activities. This area includes a range of tools and appliances that aid in the processes of preparing and cooking food, making it a crucial environment for those engaged in culinary endeavors. Overall, the Kitchen serves as an integral part of any living or dining space, reflecting its fundamental role in the daily routines of cooking and food preparation.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Contains appliances and fixtures;"N/A";"cook;clean;socializing";store";used for food preparation</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"middle of the home"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen is a designated environment specifically designed for culinary activities, serving as a functional space where various food-related tasks can take place efficiently. It is characterized by the presence of essential fixtures, appliances, and tools such as refrigerators, cabinetry, countertops, and utensils, which collectively contribute to effective food preparation and cooking. This dedicated area accommodates both cooking and cleaning facilities, as well as storage for food and other necessary items. Overall, the Kitchen is an integral space that facilitates diverse culinary tasks, ensuring a well-equipped and organized setting for food-related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen is a specialized area in a home where various culinary tasks are performed.&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen is a designated area in a home, primarily used for culinary activities, where a sink and other appliances are typically located.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-d05904a07eecb7b1c5f14ea5377015d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c20c800151aa200a235c20907fabd14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73995cd074f2d02e31397068516bddbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c0edb3fc3a6a463b9c0c513db029035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62fd5bc5149a51dfc46863346c5e8c37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d003a7dded7e53fc4b8f7d41c6ed25c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d178dad5c42c696b656b21ab2b6d2aee</data>
