    <node id="Table">
      <data key="d0">Table</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"A piece of furniture with a flat top and one or more legs, used to support objects at a convenient height."&lt;SEP&gt;The table is a central piece of furniture characterized by its rectangular shape and dark, polished surface. It features a flat surface supported by legs, making it suitable for various activities. Commonly found in room settings, the table serves as a versatile platform for placing items or working, embodying both functionality and aesthetic appeal.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be placed, used for holding items;"Can be used for dining;"Place objects on it;"support_items;"support_objects;can be cleaned.";dine;interact with items on its surface.";placing items";provide_workspace";serve_as_surface";work;working</data>
