      <data key="d6">"Center of the room; the robotic arm is extending over it; objects are distributed across its surface."&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Table is a central piece of furniture in a Domestic Interior Environment, serving as a versatile workspace that can support various items. It is characterized by its flat surface, which is supported by one or more legs, making it suitable for activities such as eating or working. In a specific scene, the Table is positioned in the center of the room and is depicted in the foreground, with a robotic arm extending over it and objects distributed across its surface. This highlights its functionality and importance as a focal point within the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The table serves as a surface for placing various items, located in the described environment.</data>
