    <node id="Red-Handled Knife">
      <data key="d0">Red-Handled Knife</data>
      <data key="d1">utensil</data>
      <data key="d2">The Red-Handled Knife is a kitchen utensil specifically designed for cutting or slicing. It is characterized by its distinct red handle, which not only adds a unique aesthetic but also provides enhanced grip and control during food preparation. This sharp tool is essential for various culinary tasks, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used to cut;"Can cut;chop food items";chop food items.";chop";serve";slice</data>
