      <data key="d6">"On the table to the left of the green apple."&lt;SEP&gt;"On the table to the left of the green apple; situated directly below the black-handled tool."</data>
      <data key="d7">The Red-Handled Knife is a kitchen utensil specifically designed for cutting or preparing food, distinguishable by its vibrant red handle. This cutting tool is commonly utilized in food preparation, emphasizing its practicality in a culinary setting. Additionally, the knife's placement above a green apple on the table highlights its association with kitchen activities and further illustrates its role in food preparation. Overall, the Red-Handled Knife is recognized as a functional and identifiable tool within the culinary environment.</data>
