      <data key="d2">"A category of tools used for cooking and food preparation."&lt;SEP&gt;Kitchen utensils are a category of tools and items utilized in cooking and food preparation. They encompass a variety of general tools and accessories that aid in the processes of preparing and serving food. Typically found in kitchens, these utensils play a crucial role in facilitating efficient cooking and meal presentation.</data>
