      <data key="d7">Kitchen utensils are a broad category of tools and implements that play a crucial role in the preparation and cooking of food. This category includes essential items such as spatulas, serving spoons, knives, and other utensils that add functionality to various culinary tasks. These tools are vital for facilitating food preparation, making cooking processes more efficient and effective.&lt;SEP&gt;Kitchen utensils are tools that assist in various cooking tasks, encompassing a wide range of items used in food preparation.</data>
