      <data key="d2">A bottle or container is an object designed to hold liquids or various items. It typically features a structure that allows for ease of pouring or dispensing the contents. Specifically, there is a description of a white bottle or container that not only serves this purpose but also has a yellow portion, indicating its specific use. Overall, bottles and containers are essential tools for storage and transportation of fluids and items.</data>
