      <data key="d7">The Bottle/Container is a white object featuring text and a yellow portion, which is likely used for holding liquids or other items. It is positioned on the left side of a table or TV stand, where it is partially visible. The descriptions collectively emphasize both the appearance and functional purpose of the Bottle/Container, confirming its role as a receptacle situated in the specified location.</data>
