    <node id="Nighttime Environment">
      <data key="d0">Nighttime Environment</data>
      <data key="d1">abstract_entity</data>
      <data key="d2">The Nighttime Environment is characterized as a dark setting illuminated by a distant light source. This illumination may simulate a celestial body, such as the moon, in the night sky, enhancing the atmospheric quality of the scene. Overall, the descriptions consistently highlight the theme of darkness contrasted with a singular, distant light, creating a serene yet mysterious ambiance.</data>
