      <data key="d6">"Global position: background of the scene; Local relation: light source is situated in the night sky"&lt;SEP&gt;"Global position: background of the scene; Local relation: light source is situated in the night sky."</data>
      <data key="d7">The Nighttime Environment is characterized by a dark background that prominently features a single white circular object, which suggests the presence of a moon or another light source in the night sky. This setting evokes a sense of a dark atmosphere, highlighting the solitary circular object as the focal point of the scene. The global position of this light source is established as being in the background of the environment, specifically positioned in the night sky. Overall, the Nighttime Environment embodies the interplay between darkness and light, emphasizing the serene yet mysterious qualities of a nocturnal setting.</data>
