      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Small Blue Object is described as a generic small item that may serve various functions in a kitchen or workshop. It is specifically identified as a small container or cap made of plastic or a similar material. This object, while utilitarian, is versatile and can be utilized for multiple purposes in both domestic and professional settings.</data>
