    <node id="Tools">
      <data key="d0">Tools</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Tools are devices or implements used to carry out particular functions in cooking, mechanical tasks, or other activities. They can encompass a wide range of instruments utilized for actions such as cutting, gripping, or crafting, making them essential items for performing various tasks across different fields and settings. Tools play a vital role in facilitating the completion of diverse activities, whether in the kitchen, for work, or during experimentation. Additionally, various tools can be organized for easy access, further enhancing their utility in everyday tasks. Overall, tools are integral instruments for effectively performing a multitude of tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"use;access";create;manipulate"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Tools are essential items utilized across a variety of environments, including kitchens, laboratories, and construction sites. They are organized to facilitate easy access and enhance functionality within these workspaces. In kitchens, tools assist in food preparation and handling materials, contributing to efficiency and precision in culinary tasks. In construction and mechanical activities, tools consist of a broad array of devices designed for manipulation and the execution of various tasks, such as pliers and other implements. Additionally, in laboratory settings, tools are systematically organized to support scientific and experimental work. Overall, tools play a pivotal role in improving productivity and enabling effective operations across diverse domains.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-df3ed2454d9a0ce69819c98cb60a8d0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c0edb3fc3a6a463b9c0c513db029035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41574791f5173705d0af68bad0eedba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380806065ffc54cff1cca7c3ed020abf</data>
