      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Kitchen tools encompass a wide range of utensils and implements that play a vital role in culinary activities. This includes essential items such as knives, graters, measuring cups, spatulas, and sponges, which facilitate various cooking and food preparation tasks. Overall, kitchen tools are integral for both cooking and cleaning in the kitchen, assisting in making the culinary process more efficient and effective.</data>
